   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "in a medium consisting of pine bark and coarse sand\nfertilised with \u201c\u201cOsmocote\u201d, lime, and micronutrients.\nOrigin\n\u2018Great Balls of Fire\u2019 arose as a chance seedling on the\napplicant\u2019s property. Selection by the applicant was on the\nbasis of its compact growth habit and the colour of its new\nfoliage. \u2018Great Balls of Fire\u2019 has been propagated by\ncuttings through 3 generations.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
