    {
     "bbox": [
      47.52,
      146.88,
      204.24,
      155.28
     ],
     "text": "Morphology \u2014 see comparison tables."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      47.52,
      156.24,
      269.28,
      165.36
     ],
     "text": "The plant is a compact well-branched dwarf shrub. The"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      47.04,
      166.32,
      277.44,
      175.44
     ],
     "text": "young leaves are usually pendulous, narrow elliptic, non-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      47.28,
      176.4,
      261.84,
      185.04
     ],
     "text": "petiolate, entire, pubescent on both sides, and greyed"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      47.28,
      186.0,
      276.96,
      195.12
     ],
     "text": "purple (RHS 183C). Mature leaves are yellow green (RHS"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.0,
      196.32,
      275.04,
      204.96
     ],
     "text": "144A to 147A) and glabrous on both sides. Young stems"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      47.52,
      206.4,
      275.04,
      215.28
     ],
     "text": "are pubescent and variably pigmented with anthocyanin."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      47.52,
      216.72,
      214.8,
      225.12
     ],
     "text": "The stems are upright and branch readily."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Morphology \u2014 see comparison tables.\nThe plant is a compact well-branched dwarf shrub. The\nyoung leaves are usually pendulous, narrow elliptic, non-\npetiolate, entire, pubescent on both sides, and greyed\npurple (RHS 183C). Mature leaves are yellow green (RHS\n144A to 147A) and glabrous on both sides. Young stems\nare pubescent and variably pigmented with anthocyanin.\nThe stems are upright and branch readily.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    47.52,
    232.56,
    283.2,
