   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Diagnosis\nThis variety is distinct from all other known varieties in\nhaving the following combination of characters: a small\nplant; ovate leaves, dark green on the upper surface and\nlight green on the underside; simple, red flowers.",
