      478.08,
      461.04,
      486.72
     ],
     "text": "Morphology \u2014 see comparison tables."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.56,
      488.16,
      519.12,
      497.28
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Sesia\u2019 is a hybrid Impatiens of compact growth habit."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.8,
      498.48,
      541.92,
      505.68
     ],
     "text": "Plants of \u2018Sesia\u2019 are shorter and narrower in diameter than"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.56,
      508.56,
      524.16,
      516.96
     ],
     "text": "those of \u2018Melissa\u2019. \u2018Sesia\u2019 leaves are dark green on the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.8,
      518.64,
      502.56,
      526.8
     ],
     "text": "upper surface (RHS 139A), in contrast to those of"
